<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Y-Learn Account Deletion Request</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.7;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background: #fff8f0;
      color: #222;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 880px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 32px 20px;
    }
    .card {
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 28px;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
      border: 1px solid #f1e3d2;
    }
    h1, h2 {
      color: #f57c00;
      line-height: 1.3;
    }
    h1 {
      margin-top: 0;
      font-size: 28px;
    }
    h2 {
      margin-top: 28px;
      font-size: 20px;
    }
    .badge {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #fff0db;
      color: #d46a00;
      padding: 6px 12px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-weight: bold;
      font-size: 13px;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }
    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #f57c00;
      color: #ffffff;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 12px 18px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-weight: bold;
      margin: 8px 0 16px;
    }
    .note {
      background: #fff7ec;
      border-left: 4px solid #f57c00;
      padding: 12px 14px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      margin: 16px 0;
    }
    ul {
      padding-left: 22px;
    }
    footer {
      margin-top: 28px;
      color: #666;
      font-size: 13px;
    }
    code {
      background: #f6f6f6;
      padding: 2px 5px;
      border-radius: 5px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="container">
    <section class="card">
      <div class="badge">Y-Learn</div>
      <h1>Account Deletion Request</h1>

      <p>
        This page explains how Y-Learn users can request deletion of their app account and associated personal data.
        Y-Learn is an educational application that supports student and lecturer learning workflows, including courses,
        sessions, assignments, submissions, rubrics, feedback, grading, and final grades.
      </p>

      <h2>How to request account deletion</h2>
      <p>
        To request deletion of your Y-Learn account, please send an email to the developer/support contact below.
      </p>

      <p>
        <a class="button" href="mailto:YOUR_SUPPORT_EMAIL_HERE?subject=Y-Learn%20Account%20Deletion%20Request&body=Hello%20Y-Learn%20Support%2C%0A%0AI%20would%20like%20to%20request%20deletion%20of%20my%20Y-Learn%20account.%0A%0ARegistered%20email%3A%20%0AAccount%20role%20(Student%2FLecturer)%3A%20%0AReason%20(optional)%3A%20%0A%0AThank%20you.">
          Request Account Deletion by Email
        </a>
      </p>

      <p>
        If the button does not open your email app, send your request manually to:
      </p>

      <p>
        <strong>Support email:</strong> <code>YOUR_SUPPORT_EMAIL_HERE</code>
      </p>

      <h2>Information to include in your request</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Your registered Y-Learn email address.</li>
        <li>Your account role, such as Student or Lecturer.</li>
        <li>A clear statement that you want your Y-Learn account deleted.</li>
        <li>Optional: your reason for requesting deletion.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>What data may be deleted</h2>
      <p>
        When your request is verified, Y-Learn may delete or deactivate account-related personal data such as:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Login account information.</li>
        <li>Name and email address associated with the app account.</li>
        <li>Profile information and profile photo preference, where applicable.</li>
        <li>Non-essential user profile records connected to the app account.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Academic records that may be retained</h2>
      <div class="note">
        Some academic data may be retained where necessary for legitimate academic, administrative, security,
        compliance, or record-keeping purposes.
      </div>

      <p>
        Academic records that may be retained can include course enrollment, assignment submissions, quiz attempts,
        grades, final grades, lecturer feedback, learning history, and other records required to preserve official
        academic assessment history.
      </p>

      <h2>Processing time</h2>
      <p>
        Account deletion requests are reviewed and processed within a reasonable period after the request is received
        and the account owner is verified. Additional verification may be required to protect the account from
        unauthorized deletion requests.
      </p>

      <h2>Indonesian Summary</h2>
      <p>
        Pengguna Y-Learn dapat meminta penghapusan akun dengan mengirim email ke kontak support/developer.
        Sertakan email terdaftar, peran akun, dan pernyataan bahwa akun Y-Learn ingin dihapus.
      </p>

      <p>
        Sebagian data akademik seperti enrollment, submission, nilai, final grade, feedback dosen, dan riwayat
        pembelajaran dapat tetap disimpan sebagai catatan akademik resmi apabila diperlukan.
      </p>

      <footer>
        Last updated: May 2026<br />
        App: Y-Learn<br />
        Developer: Yerik Afrianto Singgalen
      </footer>
    </section>
  </main>
